Subject: [PATCH] 4491: a person found by a past fact arrives with his current
 job
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The tester's re-run (box 54451, 0 of 3): the owner saved that Bakhva used to
work at TBC Bank and now works at Wissol. „Who used to work at TBC Bank?" —
search_by_insight found him by the past_role fact, and 2 of 3 runs asked the
owner where he works now, 1 said it could not confirm. Read on the seats'
tool log: an insight hit carries only the facts that matched the query
words, so the employer fact never reached the model.

Each insight hit now carries employer, jobPosition and city from the same
facts a name search reads (the owner's own or public), with their dates;
empty fields are left out, and a failed read leaves the hit as before. No
new text for the model.

